### ============================================================
### 마이페이지 APIs
### ============================================================

### ----------------------------------------------------------
### MyPage 전체 데이터 조회
### ----------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mypage
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------
### 공개 프로필 조회 (타인의 프로필)
### ----------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mypage/profile/target-user-id
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------
### 공개 프로필 조회 (비로그인)
### ----------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mypage/profile/target-user-id
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------
### 자기소개 수정
### ----------------------------------------------------------
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mypage/bio
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "bio": "안녕하세요! 함께 성장해요 💪"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------
### 프로필 이미지 변경 (URL 직접 지정)
### ----------------------------------------------------------
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mypage/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "profileImageUrl": "https://example.com/profile/image.jpg"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------
### 프로필 이미지 업로드
### ----------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mypage/profile/image
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="profile.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./test-profile.png
--boundary--

### ----------------------------------------------------------
### 보유 칭호 목록 조회
### ----------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mypage/titles
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------
### 칭호 변경 (좌측/우측 동시 설정)
### ----------------------------------------------------------
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mypage/titles
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "leftTitleId": 1,
  "rightTitleId": 2
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------
### 닉네임 중복 확인
### ----------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mypage/nickname/check?nickname=새닉네임
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------
### 닉네임 변경
### ----------------------------------------------------------
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mypage/nickname
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "nickname": "새닉네임"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------
### 닉네임 설정 필요 여부 확인
### ----------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mypage/nickname/status
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------
### 선호 언어 조회 (LUT-256 — 앱 웹뷰 NEXT_LOCALE 쿠키 유실 시 복원용)
### ----------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mypage/preferred-locale
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json
